{"seq":7,"slug":"lighting-and-flash","title":"摄影布光与照明","stage":"DONE","category":"photography-video","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/lighting-and-flash","rating":{"composite":3.69,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3,"positioning":null,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"摄影布光与照明\">摄影布光与照明</h1><p>布光是摄影里最容易被误解的一门手艺：新手以为它关乎「买更亮的灯」，老手才明白它关乎「让光按你的意图落下」。同一张脸，硬光拍出棱角与故事，柔光拍出干净与温柔；同一件商品，一支灯能拍出廉价的反光，也能拍出高级的质感。差别不在器材贵贱，而在你是否读懂了光的语言。这个 hub 就是带你从「碰运气」走到「精确控光」的一条完整路径。</p>\n<p>整个 hub 沿着四条主线层层递进，每一层都为下一层打地基。第一条是光的物理与品质：从最底层的<a href=\"light-physics/intensity-inverse-square\">光强与平方反比定律</a>，到决定影调情绪的<a href=\"light-physics/hard-soft-light\">硬光与柔光</a>，再到关乎肤色与白平衡的<a href=\"light-physics/color-temperature-cri\">色温与显色性</a>。这三件事是后面一切的词汇表——不懂平方反比就调不准光比，不懂软硬就选不对附件。</p>\n<p>第二条主线是把物理落到器材上：瞬时高能的<a href=\"lighting-gear/flash-strobe\">闪光灯与频闪</a>、所见即所得的<a href=\"lighting-gear/continuous-sources\">持续光源</a>，以及真正塑造光质的<a href=\"lighting-gear/softbox-modifiers\">柔光箱与改光附件</a>。器材本身不会布光，但它们是把第一层物理变成画面的手。</p>\n<p>第三条主线进入经典布光法，这是前人把光的规律凝练成的可复制配方：人像的<a href=\"lighting-setups/three-point-portrait\">三点布光</a>框架、戏剧性的<a href=\"lighting-setups/rembrandt-butterfly\">伦勃朗与蝴蝶光</a>，以及决定整体影调走向的<a href=\"lighting-setups/high-key-low-key\">高调与低调布光</a>。学会它们，你就有了应对绝大多数人像的起手式。</p>\n<p>第四条主线把一切拉回真实现场：没有完美棚房时如何读懂<a href=\"scenarios/natural-mixed-light\">自然光与混合光</a>，如何驯服反光与高光拍好<a href=\"scenarios/product-still-life\">产品与静物</a>，以及在明晃晃的太阳底下用<a href=\"scenarios/flash-hss-outdoor\">外拍闪光与高速同步</a>夺回曝光主导权。这一层不再讲新原理，而是把前三层的物理、器材与配方，在约束最多的真实条件下缝合成片。</p>\n<p>建议按顺序读：物理是地基，器材是工具，布光法是套路，场景是考场。读完你不会再问「该用哪盏灯」，而会先问「我想要什么样的光」——这正是布光从技术变成表达的那一刻。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"light-physics","title":"光的物理与品质","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/lighting-and-flash/light-physics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"intensity-inverse-square","title":"光强与平方反比定律","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/lighting-and-flash/light-physics/intensity-inverse-square"},{"seq":2,"slug":"hard-soft-light","title":"硬光与柔光","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/lighting-and-flash/light-physics/hard-soft-light"},{"seq":3,"slug":"color-temperature-cri","title":"色温与显色性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/lighting-and-flash/light-physics/color-temperature-cri"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"lighting-gear","title":"布光器材","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/lighting-and-flash/lighting-gear","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"flash-strobe","title":"闪光灯与频闪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/lighting-and-flash/lighting-gear/flash-strobe"},{"seq":2,"slug":"continuous-sources","title":"持续光源","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/lighting-and-flash/lighting-gear/continuous-sources"},{"seq":3,"slug":"softbox-modifiers","title":"柔光箱与改光附件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/lighting-and-flash/lighting-gear/softbox-modifiers"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"lighting-setups","title":"经典布光法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/lighting-and-flash/lighting-setups","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"three-point-portrait","title":"人像三点布光","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/lighting-and-flash/lighting-setups/three-point-portrait"},{"seq":2,"slug":"rembrandt-butterfly","title":"伦勃朗与蝴蝶光","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/lighting-and-flash/lighting-setups/rembrandt-butterfly"},{"seq":3,"slug":"high-key-low-key","title":"高调与低调布光","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/lighting-and-flash/lighting-setups/high-key-low-key"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"scenarios","title":"场景与实战","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/lighting-and-flash/scenarios","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"natural-mixed-light","title":"自然光与混合光","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/lighting-and-flash/scenarios/natural-mixed-light"},{"seq":2,"slug":"product-still-life","title":"产品与静物布光","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/lighting-and-flash/scenarios/product-still-life"},{"seq":3,"slug":"flash-hss-outdoor","title":"外拍闪光与高速同步","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/lighting-and-flash/scenarios/flash-hss-outdoor"}]}]}